A cyberpunk-style aerial view of Singapore's Marina Bay skyline at twilight, with neon-lit skyscrapers reflecting off dark waters. In the foreground, a futuristic holographic task management system floats in mid-air, showing interconnected glowing nodes and flowing data streams organized in clean hierarchical layers. The iconic Marina Bay Sands hotel glows with electric blue and magenta accents. Streaming light trails from autonomous vehicles trace paths below, suggesting constant motion and productivity. The sky displays layers of digital clouds with subtle circuit-board patterns. Rain-slicked streets mirror the cybernetic glow above, creating a sense of organized chaos transformed into systematic flow. Deep teals, hot pinks, and electric purples dominate the color palette.
